{
  "info": {
    "name": "M8 - Documentacion externa de M1",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Consultas manuales exclusivamente a M8. No ejecutada contra M1 ni Core. Usar una sesion administrativa M8 mediante m8AdminAccessToken en un entorno privado, nunca el JWT ciudadano de M1. La descarga se omite por defecto: habilitar m1FileProxyReadEnabled solo tras acordar UUID/autorizacion con M1 y autorizar una prueba remota."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{m8AdminAccessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "applicationId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "requestId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "m1FileProxyReadEnabled",
      "value": "false"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const uuid = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;",
          "if (!pm.environment.get(\"m8AdminAccessToken\") || !uuid.test(pm.variables.get(\"applicationId\") || \"\")) {",
          "  console.warn(\"Configurar m8AdminAccessToken privado y applicationId de M8.\");",
          "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Consultar referencias documentales en M8",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/applications/{{applicationId}}/external-documents",
        "description": "Exige applications:management:documents:view. Consulta referencias locales; no descarga archivos ni publica eventos. requestId es el ID documental de M1, no documentId ni eventId."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Referencias de la solicitud indicada\", () => {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  const rows = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(rows).to.be.an(\"array\");",
              "  rows.forEach(row => pm.expect(row.applicationId).to.eql(pm.variables.get(\"applicationId\")));",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Descargar archivo por el proxy M8 (opt-in)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/applications/{{applicationId}}/external-documents/{{requestId}}/file",
        "description": "Se omite salvo m1FileProxyReadEnabled=true. Solo usar con entrega COMPLETED, M1_DOCUMENTS_ENABLED y ruta UUID/credencial de servicio acordadas. Esta peticion puede provocar una consulta M8->M1 si se habilita; no se ejecuta como parte de verifyM1Integration."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const validRequestId = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(pm.variables.get(\"requestId\") || \"\");",
              "if (pm.variables.get(\"m1FileProxyReadEnabled\") !== \"true\" || !validRequestId) {",
              "  console.warn(\"Descarga omitida: requiere requestId UUID y habilitacion explicita para leer mediante M8.\");",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Archivo protegido como adjunto\", () => {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Disposition\")).to.include(\"attachment\");",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Cache-Control\")).to.include(\"no-store\");",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"X-Content-Type-Options\")).to.eql(\"nosniff\");",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"Sin credenciales remotas\", () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.has(\"Authorization\")).to.eql(false);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.has(\"X-Refresh-Token\")).to.eql(false);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
